Document the Qualcomm IPQ5018 Bluetooth controller.

Reviewed-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
Acked-by: Bartosz Golaszewski <bartosz.golaszewski@oss.qualcomm.com>
